  "description": "ADO named arguments through one GetIDsOfNames: Connection.Execute with CommandText:= and Options:= (reverse order); Recordset.Open with Source:=, ActiveConnection:=, CursorType:=, LockType:= named; Command.CreateParameter with Name:=, Type:=, Direction:=, Value:= and with Size:= before Name:=; a misspelled name (Sorce:=); the same name twice. Asks whether ADO binds names to its documented parameters, in which order, and how it refuses unknown and repeated names.",
